The file arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_64.tbl of the source of Linux, at the release 6.12 (the tag v6.12 of the
repository of Linus Torvalds). The license of the file is GPL-2.0, so the repository
keeps a copy: contract/documents/linux-6.12-arch-x86-entry-syscalls-syscall_64.tbl.

